bksmartpacker_v3

This directory contains an internal fork of the BlueKing bksmartpacker_v3
tool. It is not an unmodified copy of the upstream repository.

Upstream repository:
  ssh://git@code.cwoa.net:43990/rd-fy22-canway-platform-products/bksmartpacker_v3.git

Baseline commit:
  e2025de feat: 工具构建切换静态链接

Provenance:
  Imported from a fork working tree, including the upstream working-tree
  change that renames Makefile outputs with a "-ts4" suffix.

Local modifications present at import time:
  - BKS_CONTAINER_CLI: docker/podman runtime detection
  - BKS_LAYER_ARCHIVE, BKS_RUN_IMAGE_ARCHIVE_FILE: layer/run-image archives
  - BKS_DOCKER_SOCK, BKS_NETWORK, BKS_EXTRA_MOUNTS: runtime options
  - standalone justfile build entry

Later changes (export mode, target platform, default dest) are recorded as
separate commits. See docs/ai/bksmartpacker-fork.md for maintenance notes and
docs/ai/bksmartpacker-vs-upstream.md for the feature comparison.

No upstream LICENSE file was present at the baseline commit; this NOTICE is
the provenance record for the fork.
